  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5286ecfe08e60dafd58d3693c0c148ac77e4a38d\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"315\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5286ecfe08e60dafd58d3693c0c148ac77e4a38d\" data-origin-width=\"479\" data-origin-height=\"592\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>오랜만에 멋진 영화를 만났습니다!</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이 영화로&#160;</p><p>영상 애니메이션을 전공하는 &#39;감귤&#39;님과</p><p>수다를 떨었습니다~&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>(&#39;영화로 과학 수다&#39; 2탄 시청)</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/cgvFO3G2VAA\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/cgvFO3G2VAA</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cgvFO3G2VAA\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"480\" data-video-height=\"360\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/rcVQW/hyNumTPOCx/huDh3UKRV4RscTCVbh5xQ0/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=189_92_340_274\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"480\" data-video-origin-height=\"360\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cgvFO3G2VAA\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><b>(오늘의 영과수 어록)</b></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">과학을 쉽게 설명하려면</span></b></p><p><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">1. 어려운 용어를 쉽게 풀어쓰라!</span></b></p><p><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">2. 적절한 비유를 들어라!</span></b></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">실화가 될지도 모르는 이야기!</span></b></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">사실(fact)은 과학자에게 묻고,</span></b></p><p><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">진실(truth)은 소설가, 영화가에게 묻자!</span></b></p><p>-------------------------------------